-- 1. revoking the grant on the alias column denies the next hit
-- miss (allowed):
2
3
-- hit (allowed):
2
3
-- the same query without the cache is denied:
ACCESS_DENIED
-- hit after revoking SELECT(b) must be denied too:
ACCESS_DENIED
-- 2. a grant on the alias column alone is enough for a hit
-- miss (allowed):
2
3
-- hit (allowed, SELECT(a) is not required):
2
3
